flowchart TB
    accTitle: producerと順序制約を分けて不要passを除去する
    accDescr: 宣言順はP0 old upload、P1 unused copy、P2 replacement、P3 readback。P0の内容をP1が、P2の内容をP3が読む。WAWやWARの順序制約だけで不要なP0とP1を残さず、readbackからproducerを辿ってP2とP3だけを残す。
    subgraph before ["除去前：宣言順 P0 → P1 → P2 → P3"]
        old["P0 old upload"] -->|"内容のproducer"| unused["P1 unused copy"]
        replace["P2 replacement"] -->|"内容のproducer"| readback["P3 readback：観測起点"]
        old -. "WAW：順序制約" .-> replace
        unused -. "WAR：順序制約" .-> replace
    end
    readback -->|"必要なproducerを辿る"| cull["P0・P1を除去"]
    subgraph after ["除去後：liveだけで順序を再計算"]
        liveWrite["P2 replacement"] -->|"RAW"| liveRead["P3 readback"]
    end
    cull --> liveWrite
